# GitFlow — always merge to main

When a task is complete and verified:

1. Work on a focused branch (`fix/`, `feat/`, `chore/`).
2. Run gates before merge: `npm run typecheck`, `npm run lint`, `npm run test`, and `npm run build` when relevant.
3. **Automatically merge into `main`** — do not leave fixes only on feature branches.
4. **Push `origin main`** after merge so Vercel deploys from the updated default branch.
5. Prefer fast-forward merge when possible; one focused commit per branch is fine.

Do not ask the user to merge manually unless merge/push is blocked by permissions.

After push, confirm `main` matches `origin/main` (`git status` shows clean and up to date).
